WEBVTT

00:00:56.376 --> 00:01:00.020
taxminan 15 milliard yil avval 
barcha galaktikalar

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:03.722
bir nuqtada birlashgan.

00:01:03.722 --> 00:01:08.507
Bu Ulkan portlash, 
koinotning yaralishi edi.

00:01:08.507 --> 00:01:12.482
Ulkan portlashdan oldin ham 
biron bir narsa bo'lganmi?

00:01:12.482 --> 00:01:16.320
Agar yo'q bo'lsa, 
koinot qanday yaraldi?

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:22.204
Nima uchun Ulkan portlash natijasida 
aynan mana shunday koinot paydo bo'ldi?

00:01:22.204 --> 00:01:25.026
Avvallari koinot nazariyasini ikki qismga

00:01:25.026 --> 00:01:28.520
bo'lish mumkin deb o'ylardik.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.996
Birinchisi koinot evolyutsiyani

00:01:29.996 --> 00:01:33.700
uning muayyan vaqtdagi 
umumiy holatiga tayangan holda